+| S27 [145](/candidate/semantic.k:145) | Builtin `len` returns structural list length. | Sound for `pyList`. |
+| S28 [146](/candidate/semantic.k:146) | Binary integer `min` uses `intMin`. | Sound for submitted integer calls. |
