+- `IntList`: `nil`, `cons(Int,IntList)`.
+- `Value`: `pyInt`, `pyBool`, `pyList`, `funref`, `builtin`.
+- `Values`: comma-separated `Value`; `Strings`: comma-separated `String`;
+  `Depth`: `z` or `s(Depth)`.
+- `Program`: `Module(Stmts)`; `Params`: `Params(Strings)`; `Stmts`: a
